hich has been revealed to you from your Lord will surely increase many of them in transgression and disbelief. So do not grieve over the disbelieving people.","j":6,"h":12,"s":5,"a":68,"sd":null},{"k":"5:69","t":"Indeed, those who have believed [in Prophet Muḥammad (ﷺ)] and those [before him (ﷺ)] who were Jews or Sabeans or Christians - those [among them] who believed in Allāh and the Last Day and did righteousness - no fear will there be concerning them, nor will they grieve.","j":6,"h":12,"s":5,"a":69,"sd":null},{"k":"5:70","t":"We had already taken the covenant of the Children of Israel and had sent to them messengers. Whenever there came to them a messenger with what their souls did not desire, a party [of messengers] they denied, and another party they killed.","j":6,"h":12,"s":5,"a":70,"sd":null}],"juz":6,"hizb":12,"surahs":[5],"sajdah":false}